{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "56135b4f-5c3d-85ad-8434-b0e96c4da2a1",
  "created_at": "2025-12-19T09:21:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anthony Fiore",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:17:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:17:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, good morning. Anthony Fiore, 144 Dixon Street, up the North End. I got a notice here says my payment bounced. Bounced! I never had a payment bounce in my life."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:17:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me pull that up. Do you have your account number handy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:18:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do, I got the bill right here. It's 38108249210."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:18:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Let me read that back, three eight one zero eight two four nine two one zero. That's it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:18:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Sí, that's the one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:18:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, give me a second here. [pause] All right, I see the water and sewer bill, and I see the bank payment came back returned. It shows the account still has that balance open."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:18:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's wrong, the money was in there. I looked at it. Mi banco, they tell me nothing is wrong on their end. So now what, I got a late charge coming or what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:18:43-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can see why you're irritated. What I can tell you is the return came back from the bank side, and the balance is open right now. A late charge depends on the due date, and I can see it's not past that yet on this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:19:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not past yet. Okay. That's something at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:19:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Now, if you think the bank end was an error, you'll want to sort that out with them too, because they'd have the reason code for the return."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I already called them, they just send me around in circles. Listen, can you send me a copy of this bill? A duplicate, by email. The paper one I got is all wrinkled, my coffee, you know. Perdón."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:19:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. I can send a duplicate to the email on file. Do you want me to confirm what we have for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:19:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, check it. I don't remember if it's the old one or the new one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:19:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got one that ends in a Gmail address, starts with A, Fiore. Does that sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:19:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the one, that's good. Send it there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Done, it should be in your inbox in a few minutes. Check spam too, just in case."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:20:02-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Now, how do I dispute this charge? Formally, I mean. Not just talking on the phone. I want it in writing, that it's not my fault the thing bounced, porque I did nothing wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:20:15-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. For a formal dispute, you'd send a written request to the utilities billing office, with your name, the service address, your account number, and what you're disputing and why. Include the bank's statement if you have it. Mail it or drop it off at City Hall, and ask for something back that shows it was received."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:20:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A letter. Okay. I can do a letter. My granddaughter, she types better than me, ella me ayuda."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:20:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. And once it's in, billing will review it and get back to you in writing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:20:49-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. You know, I got enough going on. My friend Sal's wedding is next month, and I'm dreading it and looking forward to it, both. Dreading the suit, looking forward to the food. Anyway, I don't need this headache on top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:21:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Hopefully we get this squared away before then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:21:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, well. So the email, the letter, and nothing's late yet. That's what I got?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:21:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Balance is open, due date hasn't passed, duplicate is on its way, and your dispute goes in writing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:21:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Tony. Have a good one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T09:21:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Fiore. Take care."
    }
  ],
